# Run 415 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# The harness is a read-only path/reference consistency verifier; it generates nothing under the
# repository tree. Any transient run output (summaries, extracted path lists, self-test scratch
# copies) is written to a staging directory OUTSIDE the package tree (runner temp) and MUST NOT be
# committed. Only publish-safe OK/POSITIVE/NONE status lines appear in the tracked summary.
material/
node/
nodes/
logs/
data/
artifact-staging/
selftest.criteria.md
selftest.index/
selftest.tree/
st_*.md
*.err
*.log
*.out
*.help.txt
*.usage.txt
*.kem.sk.bin
*.cert.bin
*.key
*.pem
metrics*.txt
*.generated.json
READINESS_ARTIFACT_PATH_REFERENCE_LINT_REPORT.json
READINESS_ARTIFACT_PATH_REFERENCE_LINT_REPORT.txt